  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes, especially when sentiment is neutral or negative.",
    "Adjust forecasts downward if sentiment turns negative (e.g., -0.25 or below) and price is trending upward.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is significantly above recent 15-day average, reduce by 5-10% in next period.",
    "Increase downward bias when sentiment is positive (e.g., +0.50) and price is trending downward.",
    "Lag correction: if true outcome is below forecast, reduce next period’s forecast by 10-15% to account for delayed reaction.",
    "Avoid overreacting to short-term sentiment shifts; use 3-5 day smoothing for sentiment impact."
  ]
